Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when you train at the gym,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,the ideal is a progressive\Ntraining load,
